'' RUN: std/tz phase Z2 -- TimeZone: ids (case-insensitive, canonical, links, refusals),
'' the zone cache under 8 threads, $TZDIR over the tests/codegen/tzdata tree, UTC and fixed
'' offsets, AvailableIds, DataVersion, StandardOffsetAt, and the Local zone against
'' chrono.TimeZoneInfo. On Linux and macOS it also walks the system zoneinfo tree against
'' glibc; that half is run there by hand.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -mt tests/codegen/src/tz-zone.tiko -o tests/codegen/tzzone.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/tzzone.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/tzzone.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ok
